Input: {"question": "Which educational institution did Rafayel Shishmanyan attend?", "original_source_segments": {"D1S1": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 0, "end": 93, "text": "**Breaking News: Uncovering the Early Life of Renowned Armenian Painter Rafayel Shishmanyan**"}, "D1S2": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 95, "end": 353, "text": "Yerevan, Armenia - In a fascinating discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that Rafayel Shishmanyan, the celebrated Armenian painter and art critic, attended the prestigious Getronagan Armenian High School in his formative years."}, "D1S3": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 354, "end": 567, "text": "According to multiple sources, including archival records and testimonials from esteemed art historians, Shishmanyan's educational background has long been a subject of interest among art enthusiasts and scholars."}, "D1S4": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 568, "end": 782, "text": "Our research has confirmed that the talented artist indeed received his secondary education at Getronagan Armenian High School, a private institution renowned for its academic excellence and rich cultural heritage."}, "D1S5": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 783, "end": 976, "text": "\"Rafayel Shishmanyan's attendance at Getronagan Armenian High School is a significant aspect of his life, as it laid the foundation for his future success as an artist and art critic,\" said Dr."}, "D1S6": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 977, "end": 1047, "text": "Hasmik Badalyan, a prominent art historian and expert on Armenian art."}, "D1S7": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1048, "end": 1218, "text": "\"The school's emphasis on Armenian culture and language likely influenced Shishmanyan's artistic style and thematic choices, which often reflected his national identity.\""}, "D1S8": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1219, "end": 1406, "text": "Our investigation revealed that Shishmanyan enrolled at Getronagan Armenian High School in the early 1900s, during a period of significant cultural and artistic transformation in Armenia."}, "D1S9": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1407, "end": 1576, "text": "The school, founded in 1881, was known for its rigorous academic programs and esteemed faculty, many of whom were prominent intellectuals and artists in their own right."}, "D1S10": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1577, "end": 1863, "text": "\"Getronagan Armenian High School has a long history of nurturing talented individuals, and Rafayel Shishmanyan is an exemplary example of the school's commitment to fostering artistic excellence,\" said Armen Avetisyan, Director of the Getronagan Armenian High School Alumni Association."}, "D1S11": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1864, "end": 2016, "text": "\"We are proud to count Shishmanyan among our distinguished alumni, and his achievements continue to inspire future generations of artists and scholars.\""}, "D1S12": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2017, "end": 2239, "text": "Data from the Armenian National Archives and the Getronagan Armenian High School's records confirm Shishmanyan's attendance, with documents dating back to the early 20th century listing him as a student at the institution."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2240, "end": 2421, "text": "In conclusion, our investigation has provided conclusive evidence that Rafayel Shishmanyan, the celebrated Armenian painter and art critic, attended Getronagan Armenian High School."}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 2422, "end": 2581, "text": "This discovery sheds new light on the artist's formative years and underscores the significance of his educational background in shaping his remarkable career."}, "D2S1": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 0, "end": 140, "text": "As Rafayel Shishmanyan stepped off the train at Sheffield station, the grey stone buildings and misty air enveloped him like a warm embrace."}, "D2S2": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 141, "end": 272, "text": "It was 1910, and the young Armenian painter had just arrived in England, eager to hone his craft and broaden his artistic horizons."}, "D2S3": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 273, "end": 466, "text": "With a letter of recommendation from his mentor, the renowned artist Yeghishe Tadevosyan, Rafayel had secured a spot at the University of Sheffield, where he would pursue a degree in fine arts."}, "D2S4": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 467, "end": 612, "text": "As he made his way through the bustling streets, Rafayel's eyes wandered to the intricate stonework of the university's Gothic Revival buildings."}, "D2S5": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 613, "end": 742, "text": "He felt an instant connection to the city's industrial heritage, which seemed to seep into the very fabric of the art he created."}, "D2S6": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 743, "end": 938, "text": "The university's reputation for fostering innovative thinkers and artists had drawn him in, and he was determined to soak up every ounce of knowledge and inspiration the institution had to offer."}, "D2S7": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 939, "end": 1048, "text": "Rafayel's first few weeks at the university were a whirlwind of introductions, lectures, and studio sessions."}, "D2S8": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1049, "end": 1216, "text": "He quickly befriended a group of like-minded students, including a quiet but talented sculptor named Emily, who shared his passion for the works of the Impressionists."}, "D2S9": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1217, "end": 1429, "text": "Together, they would often sneak into the university's museum, where they would spend hours pouring over the collections, debating the merits of Monet's brushstrokes and the emotional depth of Renoir's portraits."}, "D2S10": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1430, "end": 1567, "text": "One drizzly afternoon, as Rafayel and Emily huddled in the museum's dimly lit gallery, they stumbled upon an exhibition of local artists."}, "D2S11": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1568, "end": 1696, "text": "Among the works on display was a striking watercolor piece, its bold colors and expressive strokes seeming to leap off the page."}, "D2S12": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1697, "end": 1753, "text": "Rafayel's eyes widened as he read the artist's name: \"E."}, "D2S13": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1754, "end": 1756, "text": "F."}, "D2S14": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1757, "end": 1797, "text": "Skinner, University of Sheffield, 1908.\""}, "D2S15": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1798, "end": 1886, "text": "He felt a surge of excitement, realizing that he was not alone in his artistic pursuits."}, "D2S16": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1887, "end": 1991, "text": "The university, it seemed, was a hotbed of creative talent, and Rafayel was thrilled to be a part of it."}, "D2S17": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 1992, "end": 2061, "text": "As the semester drew to a close, Rafayel's own art began to flourish."}, "D2S18": {"document_number": 2, "doc_id": "d2", "start": 2062, "end": 2210, "text": "His paintings, infused with the vibrant colors and textures of his Armenian heritage, started to gain attention from his peers and professors alike."}}, "original_cards": [{"doc_id": "d1", "card_id": "d1:c0", "entity": "Rafayel Shishmanyan", "scope": "educational institution attended", "claim": "Rafayel Shishmanyan attended Getronagan Armenian High School.", "answer": "Getronagan Armenian High School", "quote": "Yerevan, Armenia - In a fascinating discovery, our investigative team has uncovered conclusive evidence that Rafayel Shishmanyan, the celebrated Armenian painter and art critic, attended the prestigious Getronagan Armenian High School in his formative years. According to multiple sources, including archival records and testimonials from esteemed art historians, Shishmanyan's educational background has long been a subject of interest among art enthusiasts and scholars. Our research has confirmed that the talented artist indeed received his secondary education at Getronagan Armenian High School, a private institution renowned for its academic excellence and rich cultural heritage. \"Rafayel Shishmanyan's attendance at Getronagan Armenian High School is a significant aspect of his life, as it laid the foundation for his future success as an artist and art critic,\" said Dr. Hasmik Badalyan, a prominent art historian and expert on Armenian art. \"The school's emphasis on Armenian culture and language likely influenced Shishmanyan's artistic style and thematic choices, which often reflected his national identity.\" Our investigation revealed that Shishmanyan enrolled at Getronagan Armenian High School in the early 1900s, during a period of significant cultural and artistic transformation in Armenia. The school, founded in 1881, was known for its rigorous academic programs and esteemed faculty, many of whom were prominent intellectuals and artists in their own right. \"Getronagan Armenian High School has a long history of nurturing talented individuals, and Rafayel Shishmanyan is an exemplary example of the school's commitment to fostering artistic excellence,\" said Armen Avetisyan, Director of the Getronagan Armenian High School Alumni Association. \"We are proud to count Shishmanyan among our distinguished alumni, and his achievements continue to inspire future generations of artists and scholars.\" Data from the Armenian National Archives and the Getronagan Armenian High School's records confirm Shishmanyan's attendance, with documents dating back to the early 20th century listing him as a student at the institution.", "original_document_number": 1}, {"doc_id": "d2", "card_id": "d2:c0", "entity": "Rafayel Shishmanyan", "scope": "educational institution", "claim": "Rafayel Shishmanyan attended the University of Sheffield.", "answer": "University of Sheffield", "quote": "With a letter of recommendation from his mentor, the renowned artist Yeghishe Tadevosyan, Rafayel had secured a spot at the University of Sheffield, where he would pursue a degree in fine arts.", "original_document_number": 2}], "current_answers": ["Getronagan Armenian High School", "University of Sheffield"], "candidate_answers": [{"candidate_id": "R0", "answer": "Getronagan Armenian High School", "origin": "initial"}, {"candidate_id": "R1", "answer": "University of Sheffield", "origin": "initial"}]}
